1. She previously worked at a zoo for a period of time. (Verbatim: "i've worked at a zoo i worked at a zoo for for a while")
2. She has experience caring for specific animals including giraffes, rhinos, and axolotls. (Verbatim: "i never looked after flamingos so that's why there's a flamingo picture" / "i actually did look after one of these" [referring to axolotl] / "i've looked after rhinos")
