5. She finds axolotls funny and enjoyable to care for despite their slow reaction time. (Verbatim: "they're the funniest things to look after" / "it was always so funny")
6. She has knowledge about animal behavior, specifically that rhinos enjoy being scratched but can be dangerous. (Verbatim: "rhinos also like the scritchy scritches but i remember having to be extremely careful when giving the scritchy scritches to the rhino because they weren't joking it would unalive me very fast")
