8. She has experience feeding axolotls as part of her daily duties at the zoo. (Verbatim: "i had the daily job of feeding the axolotl")
9. She is skilled at spotting well-camouflaged or hidden animals, especially reptiles. (Verbatim: "i'm quite good at like spotting the like more cryptic animals you know the ones that are like hiding and a lot of reptiles do that")
10. She felt conflicted about pretending to be Australian to avoid disappointing a fellow tourist. (Verbatim: "we didn't have the heart to tell her... i felt bad correcting her but then i felt bad going along with it") [end of text]



